t("Solipsist", "Solipsist", "birth descriptor name")
t("Some believe that the world is the collective dream of those that live in it.  Find and wake the sleeper and you'll unlock the potential of your dreams.", "Some believe that the world is the collective dream of those that live in it.  Find and wake the sleeper and you'll unlock the potential of your dreams.", "_t")
t("The Solipsist believes that reality is malleable and nothing more than the collective vision of those that experience it.", "The Solipsist believes that reality is malleable and nothing more than the collective vision of those that experience it.", "_t")
t("They wield this knowledge to both create and destroy, to invade the minds of others, and to manipulate the dreams of those around them.", "They wield this knowledge to both create and destroy, to invade the minds of others, and to manipulate the dreams of those around them.", "_t")
t("This knowledge comes with a heavy price and the Solipsist must guard his thoughts, lest he come to believe that the world exists only within his own mind.", "This knowledge comes with a heavy price and the Solipsist must guard his thoughts, lest he come to believe that the world exists only within his own mind.", "_t")
